# Local app sign-in

Do not sign in by default. Sign into the **local** app only when a test or task needs a member session.

`CURSORAGENT_LOGIN` and `CURSORAGENT_PASSWORD` are Cloud Agent secrets. Local Cursor usually will not have them.

1. If either var is unset, skip login and say so.
2. Open `/login` or `/auth?mode=login`.
3. Fill email and password from those env vars, then Sign In.
4. Never print, log, commit, or echo the values.
